<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mexico's Sigma starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mexico's Sigma starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- ING Barings analyst Ana Maria Mendez said she had started coverage of Mexican food company Sigma Alimentos SA de CV with a rating of hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Although the company is expected to see strong earnings growth in 1997 and 1998, Ms. Mendez reports that Sigma is not generating sufficient cash to fund its aggressive expansion strategies, and will have to increase debt levels and reduce shareholder dividend payouts in the next few years,&quot; Barings said in a Jan 20 report.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
